OL,3,GNEWSAGovernments should explore talks
OL,4,Awith paramilitary groups - report
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe British and Irish governments
OL,7,Fshould explore direct engagement with
OL,8,Fparamilitary groups to help achieve
OL,9,Ftheir disbandment, a report has
OL,10,Frecommended.
OL,12,FIt stated there should be no financial
OL,13,Frewards as part of the process.
OL,15,FThe report, by an expert in conflict
OL,16,Fresolution, was requested by London and
OL,17,FDublin to gauge if the approach had
OL,18,F"merit and support".
OL,20,FIt recommended the governments set-up
OL,21,F"a transition mechanism without delay".
OL,23,APub: 13-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
